   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s015",
   "start": 45.8,
   "end": 49.48,
   "line": "Skip. The queue for the bus? Skip. Waiting for the pizza?",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s016",
   "start": 49.48,
   "end": 51.68,
   "line": "Skip, and it's hot on the table.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s017",
   "start": 51.68,
   "end": 57.24,
   "line": "Then your mum asks why your homework is never done. And that's the catch.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s018",
   "start": 57.24,
   "end": 61.88,
   "line": "When you skip the boring part, you also skip the time you needed to do it.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s019",
   "start": 61.88,
   "end": 66.92,
   "line": "Your friend tries to understand. Where do you go? Nowhere. I just get there later.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s020",
   "start": 66.92,
   "end": 70.28,
   "line": "And that's exactly how real time travel works.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s021",
   "start": 70.28,
   "end": 74.12,
   "line": "A hundred years ago, Einstein worked out something wild.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s022",
   "start": 74.12,
   "end": 79.32,
   "line": "The faster you move, the slower your clock ticks, compared with someone standing still.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s023",
   "start": 79.32,
   "end": 82.3,
   "line": "It sounds like science fiction. So in 1971,",
